### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Get all posts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts

### Create
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Learning Express","content":"Express helps build REST APIs.","authorName":"Student","category":"Node.js"}

### Get one (replace ID)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts/POST_ID

### Update (replace ID)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/posts/POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Updated Express Blog"}

### Delete (replace ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/posts/POST_ID
